The following documents form the Contract and shall be read as one. In case of conflict they take precedence in the order listed:

- this Contract Agreement;
- the Conditions of Contract (Part II);
- Appendix B - Performance Guarantees and Liquidated Damages;
- Appendix C - Schedule of Payments;
- Appendix D - Scope of Works Split and Terminal Points;
- Appendix A - Employer's Requirements (technical);
- Appendix E - Site and Design Data;
- Appendix G - Key Dates;
- the Contractor's technical proposal, to the extent it is consistent with the documents above.
